{"id":"n79657-1-9","stage":4,"title":"초인종 · 门铃","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79657-1-9-1","ko":"초인종이 고장 났나 봐요. 단추를 눌렀는데도 아무런 소리가 안 나요.","zh":"门铃好像坏了。按了按钮却没有任何声音。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"초인종이","meaning":"门铃","explanation":"초인종：门铃；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"초인종","audio":"/audio/44120ff5101c2f82ee60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79657","senseId":"1","lemma":"초인종","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고장","meaning":"故障","explanation":"고장：故障","readings":[{"term":"고장","audio":"/audio/a1a759c684921a8dd35e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18856","senseId":"1","lemma":"고장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"났나","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐요.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"단추를","meaning":"按钮，按键","explanation":"단추：按钮，按键；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"단추","audio":"/audio/8ab17bb5575e5c161e5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28375","senseId":"2","lemma":"단추","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눌렀는데도","meaning":"按，压，摁","explanation":"누르다：按，压，摁；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"누르다","audio":"/audio/aaaee287bf5aed197d56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72239","senseId":"1","lemma":"누르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아무런","meaning":"什么","explanation":"아무런：什么","readings":[{"term":"아무런","audio":"/audio/79942a159da2d83cd853.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71332","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소리가",